      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.48,
          "end": 2.73,
          "en": "In this course section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.73,
          "end": 6.33,
          "en": "we'll dive into a brand new demo project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.33,
          "end": 10.32,
          "en": "and we're going to build this project from scratch,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.32,
          "end": 12,
          "en": "from the ground up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12,
          "end": 16.44,
          "en": "And whilst building this project, we will continue working",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.44,
          "end": 19.68,
          "en": "with side effects and the useEffect hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.68,
          "end": 24.15,
          "en": "And therefore, the idea behind this course section here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.15,
          "end": 28.74,
          "en": "is to give you an opportunity to practice what you learned.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 28.74,
          "end": 33.48,
          "en": "And to dive a bit deeper into React and effects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 33.48,
          "end": 36.42,
          "en": "Therefore, in this section, you can apply",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 36.42,
          "end": 39.96,
          "en": "your existing React and effects knowledge.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 39.96,
          "end": 41.55,
          "en": "We'll continue dealing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 41.55,
          "end": 45.18,
          "en": "with effect dependencies and cleanup functions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 45.18,
          "end": 47.82,
          "en": "so that you get a better feeling for",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 47.82,
          "end": 51.06,
          "en": "when to add and use those things.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 51.06,
          "end": 54.57,
          "en": "And since we're going to build a brand new project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 54.57,
          "end": 55.95,
          "en": "from the ground up,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 55.95,
          "end": 59.55,
          "en": "you will also see how you can combine effects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 59.55,
          "end": 62.37,
          "en": "with other React concepts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 62.37,
          "end": 67.23,
          "en": "And therefore, in this section you can absolutely",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 67.23,
          "end": 71.82,
          "en": "try building this project on your own as a practice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 71.82,
          "end": 73.86,
          "en": "But the main idea indeed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 73.86,
          "end": 77.37,
          "en": "is that we'll build it together step by step,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 77.37,
          "end": 80.49,
          "en": "that I explain why we build it like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 80.49,
          "end": 84.27,
          "en": "and that therefore, whilst you are following along",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 84.27,
          "end": 86.37,
          "en": "and you're also building it on your own,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 86.37,
          "end": 88.38,
          "en": "whilst watching those videos,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 88.38,
          "end": 90.33,
          "en": "you get a better understanding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 90.33,
          "end": 93.15,
          "en": "of all these crucial concepts.",
          "zh": ""
